#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:1
#: 04d0e49d229e460daa5d1c6bc22ca41c
msgid "Install Environment"
msgstr "环境安装"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:3
#: 0aa10e74cf194678b682305f28f409c9
msgid ""
"This page covers installing the base development environment for FiveAges"
" Sim workspaces."
msgstr "本页介绍如何安装 FiveAges Sim 工作空间所需的基础开发环境。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:5
#: c86cd628a8604a2aa48ee997c2fddae8
msgid "Operating System"
msgstr "操作系统"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:7
#: c77d73521477434c91b8dd6e50a90a96
msgid "**Supported:** Ubuntu 24.04 LTS (Noble Numbat)"
msgstr "**支持：** Ubuntu 24.04 LTS（Noble Numbat）"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:9
#: f1ee8ec6d4be4aadb9e9525bfe59f835
msgid ""
"**Python:** **3.12** only (ROS 2 Jazzy on Ubuntu 24.04). Do not use "
"3.10/3.11 venvs for this stack."
msgstr ""
"**Python：** 仅 **3.12**（Ubuntu 24.04 上的 ROS 2 Jazzy）。本技术栈不要使用 3.10/3.11 "
"虚拟环境。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:11
#: 5e597e81a4ee4c8891cb54fe67eb956e
msgid ""
"Follow the [open-deploy-ws README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-"
"deploy-ws/blob/main/README.EN.md) for ROS 2 + rosdep. The workspace entry"
" is **`./init_repo.sh`**; after `colcon build`, `source "
"install/setup.bash` in the launch terminal."
msgstr ""
"ROS 2 + rosdep 按 [open-deploy-ws README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim"
"/open-deploy-ws/blob/main/README.EN.md)。不要自造 `~/.bashrc` overlay；工作区只有 "
"**`./init_repo.sh`**，没有 setup/env 脚本。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:13
#: 70308dfe25014cd1b06cd44e45df3593
msgid "ROS 2 Jazzy + rosdep (open-deploy-ws README)"
msgstr "ROS 2 Jazzy + rosdep（open-deploy-ws README）"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:15
#: 2d365b5ccca5406bb25b0612323e9595
msgid ""
"# 1. ROS 2 helper (fishros) — listed first in that README\n"
"wget http://fishros.com/install -O fishros && bash fishros\n"
"\n"
"# 2. ROS 2 Jazzy Desktop\n"
"sudo apt update\n"
"sudo apt install ros-jazzy-desktop\n"
"\n"
"# 3. rosdep (first time on this machine)\n"
"sudo rosdep init\n"
"rosdep update"
msgstr ""
"# 1. ROS 2 helper (fishros) — listed first in that README\n"
"wget http://fishros.com/install -O fishros && bash fishros\n"
"\n"
"# 2. ROS 2 Jazzy Desktop\n"
"sudo apt update\n"
"sudo apt install ros-jazzy-desktop\n"
"\n"
"# 3. rosdep (first time on this machine)\n"
"sudo rosdep init\n"
"rosdep update"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:28
#: d4bd97d14f0541af95f0a648dffbec26
msgid ""
"Official ROS 2 Jazzy install (if you are not using fishros): "
"[docs.ros.org — Jazzy](https://docs.ros.org/en/jazzy/Installation.html). "
"After ROS is installed, **clone a deploy workspace and run "
"`./init_repo.sh`**, then `source install/setup.bash` after `colcon "
"build`."
msgstr ""
"若不用 fishros，官方 ROS 2 Jazzy 安装见 [docs.ros.org — "
"Jazzy](https://docs.ros.org/en/jazzy/Installation.html)。装好 ROS "
"后，**克隆部署工作区并运行 `./init_repo.sh`** — 不要把手工 `source /opt/ros/...` + 工作区 "
"overlay 写进 `~/.bashrc` 当作文档路径。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:30
#: 881a831242a04c93a30807e5153de764
msgid "OCS2 Installation"
msgstr "安装 OCS2"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:32
#: 86b0ab213aa3417a85d447f0b6e8be3f
msgid "OCS2 (Optimal Control for Switched Systems) is a core dependency."
msgstr "OCS2（切换系统最优控制，Optimal Control for Switched Systems）是核心依赖。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:34
#: 85a94cd0dd7b448b9fac12e9fbf1ec47
msgid ""
"OCS2 is **not** published to Debian / ROS apt software sources. The "
"`.deb` package name is still `ros-jazzy-ocs2`. **Do not** treat `sudo apt"
" install` or a hand-run `dpkg -i` as the primary path."
msgstr ""
"OCS2 **没有**发布到 Debian / ROS apt 软件源。`.deb` 包名仍是 `ros-jazzy-ocs2`。**不要**把 "
"`sudo apt install` 或手跑 `dpkg -i` 当作主路径。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:36
#: a08c739b39c6480d94b1a72ddef624e3
msgid ""
"Use the deploy-workspace scripts in `open-deploy-ws` or `fa-deploy-ws`. "
"They already switch and install OCS2 (GitHub Release `.deb` or source)."
msgstr ""
"使用 `open-deploy-ws` 或 `fa-deploy-ws` 的部署工作空间脚本。它们已经负责切换并安装 OCS2（GitHub "
"Release `.deb` 或源码）。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:38
#: 657d1e3cd233494186abbfba7904bca7
msgid ""
"cd ~/open-deploy-ws   # or fa-deploy-ws\n"
"./init_repo.sh"
msgstr ""
"cd ~/open-deploy-ws   # or fa-deploy-ws\n"
"./init_repo.sh"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:43
#: 70308dfe25014cd1b06cd44e45df3593
msgid "What the script does (from the open-deploy-ws README):"
msgstr "脚本做什么（摘自 open-deploy-ws README）："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:38
#: 3c8dee35376445468aafca7eb7911661
msgid "Menu"
msgstr "菜单"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:38
#: 8628c02cd9bc405aa4fff2a6434aa514
msgid "Role"
msgstr "作用"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:38
#: 78f47f9c45cb45518b80a9ad603f1c28
msgid "**1) 初始化工作空间**"
msgstr "**1) 初始化工作空间**"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:38
#: 462dcae952ec44ea9356f78b2821d25a
msgid ""
"Nested visibility, then per-module `d` (GitHub Release `.deb`) or `s` "
"(source). OCS2 default is **deb**."
msgstr "先选嵌套可见性，再按模块选 `d`（GitHub Release `.deb`）或 `s`（源码）。OCS2 默认是 **deb**。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:38
#: 44339690846e4674b4c2417912ffa85d
msgid "**2) 切换模块安装方式**"
msgstr "**2) 切换模块安装方式**"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:38
#: 6ad249b032df4ae3817ddf3184602f65
msgid ""
"Switch an already-initialized module **source ↔ deb** (cleans conflicting"
" source or uninstalls the matching deb). Use this to change the OCS2 "
"install path."
msgstr "把已初始化模块在 **源码 ↔ deb** 之间切换（清理冲突源码或卸载对应 deb）。用这个改 OCS2 安装路径。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:38
#: 362062010da442b9af08bc395db0980e
msgid "**3) 仅安装/更新核心 deb**"
msgstr "**3) 仅安装/更新核心 deb**"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:38
#: 34a252f53b604a55b2c34a3025c8d647
msgid "Skip Git; e.g. `./scripts/install_core_debs.sh --only ocs2`"
msgstr "跳过 Git；例如 `./scripts/install_core_debs.sh --only ocs2`"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:38
#: 4ad03bf6337a4de58990affb8af93392
msgid "**4) 卸载核心 deb**"
msgstr "**4) 卸载核心 deb**"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:38
#: c46a5dc8eb3942e18eb0794a23a32a5b
msgid "e.g. `./scripts/uninstall_core_debs.sh --only ocs2`"
msgstr "例如 `./scripts/uninstall_core_debs.sh --only ocs2`"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:38
#: a2a1ca4d0b7c4b68bb6401209c4eeb23
msgid "**5) 仅运行 rosdep**"
msgstr "**5) 仅运行 rosdep**"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:38
#: e444754d7e5b4b00a12fb5e2a5d9b3be
msgid "`rosdep install` on `src/` only"
msgstr "只对 `src/` 跑 `rosdep install`"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:53
#: f1b891f2e366439694cc374441e06c44
msgid ""
"Choosing `d` downloads the matching GitHub Release asset via "
"`scripts/install_core_debs.sh`. It does **not** install from "
"packages.ros.org. After init, you still `colcon build`."
msgstr ""
"选 `d` 会通过 `scripts/install_core_debs.sh` 下载匹配的 GitHub Release 资源。**不会**从 "
"packages.ros.org 安装。init 之后仍需 `colcon build`。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:55
#: f482309af9184b54bb3510ced11d15c0
msgid "Manual fallback"
msgstr "手动回退"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:58
#: f7166ab0e8704d06aa1464097a1be3ec
msgid ""
"Only if you are not using a deploy workspace. Download the matching asset"
" for your architecture and ROS distro from [ocs2_ros2 "
"Releases](https://github.com/legubiao/ocs2_ros2/releases) (filename "
"pattern `ros-jazzy-ocs2_*_<arch>.deb`), then `sudo dpkg -i ros-jazzy-"
"ocs2_*.deb` and `sudo apt-get install -f` if dpkg reports missing "
"dependencies. For source: clone branch `ros2` into `src/` — or choose `s`"
" in `./init_repo.sh`."
msgstr ""
"仅当你没有使用部署工作空间时。从 [ocs2_ros2 "
"Releases](https://github.com/legubiao/ocs2_ros2/releases) 下载匹配架构和 ROS "
"发行版的资源（文件名形如 `ros-jazzy-ocs2_*_<arch>.deb`），然后 `sudo dpkg -i ros-jazzy-"
"ocs2_*.deb`；若 dpkg 报缺依赖再 `sudo apt-get install -f`。源码：把 `ros2` 分支克隆进 "
"`src/` — 或在 `./init_repo.sh` 里选 `s`。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:61
#: e3d9aaf2b2d8419391790c75dfb31617
msgid "Simulation Dependencies"
msgstr "仿真依赖"

