#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:69
#: f49c9a6f0b894e48aad4e0ea4cbbb4b8
msgid "Isaac Sim"
msgstr "Isaac Sim"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:71
#: 0d036bdf6e6f40ad9754f90afd54e0e8
msgid ""
"Use **FaSim-Isaac** scripts. Path and version live in config, not in a "
"hardcoded minor version in these docs."
msgstr "使用 **FaSim-Isaac** 脚本。路径和版本写在配置里，不要在这些文档里写死某一个次版本号。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:73
#: 113fde0c620b4933a8e9e8d428498ea9
msgid ""
"Default install directory: `ISAACSIM_DIR` (`~/isaacsim` unless you set it"
" in `config/fa_sim.local.conf` or the environment)"
msgstr ""
"默认安装目录：`ISAACSIM_DIR`（除非在 `config/fa_sim.local.conf` 或环境变量里设置，否则为 "
"`~/isaacsim`）"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:74
#: 4cac607f90334e5995fba8f27793e2db
msgid ""
"Optional Isaac ROS 2 Jazzy workspace version: `./init.sh` operation 2 "
"menu (queries GitHub stable tags; fallback list in `config/fa_sim.conf` "
"currently `6.0.1` / `6.0.0` / `5.1.0`). Override with "
"`ISAAC_SIM_VERSION=… ./init.sh`"
msgstr ""
"可选 Isaac ROS 2 Jazzy 工作空间版本：`./init.sh` 操作 2 菜单（查询 GitHub 稳定 tag；回退列表见 "
"`config/fa_sim.conf`，目前是 `6.0.1` / `6.0.0` / `5.1.0`）。用 "
"`ISAAC_SIM_VERSION=… ./init.sh` 覆盖。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:76
#: 6e1622e20f6349c1b93bf3f037e0f2e0
msgid ""
"git clone git@github.com:fiveages-sim/FaSim-Isaac.git\n"
"cd FaSim-Isaac\n"
"./init.sh    # 1) submodules  2) optional Isaac ROS 2 Jazzy workspace\n"
"./run.sh     # menu: PhysX / Newton / Headless Streaming"
msgstr ""
"git clone git@github.com:fiveages-sim/FaSim-Isaac.git\n"
"cd FaSim-Isaac\n"
"./init.sh    # 1) submodules  2) optional Isaac ROS 2 Jazzy workspace\n"
"./run.sh     # menu: PhysX / Newton / Headless Streaming"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/2-install_environment.md:83
#: 0e5a9dabfcd14a0dbf445da8fd6d53b9
msgid ""
"Copy `config/fa_sim.local.template.conf` → `config/fa_sim.local.conf` to "
"change `ISAACSIM_DIR` or the default version. See the [Isaac Sim how-"
"to](../2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md)."
msgstr ""
"复制 `config/fa_sim.local.template.conf` → `config/fa_sim.local.conf` 以修改 "
"`ISAACSIM_DIR` 或默认版本。见 [Isaac Sim "
"操作指南](../2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md)。"

